,{"client_msg_id":"d7d50415-deb9-4992-b70c-697a7f662f16","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"暗黙的な挙動とかはなくて明快なんです","ts":"1637738424.093200","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"naruhodo","count":1,"users":["U017BU3UZBQ"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"UQOSq"}]},{"client_msg_id":"29a82b87-db26-43ca-8d5a-61c8bdc82e74","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"それは設定したとおりになりますね","ts":"1637738413.092600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"/6Tz"}]},{"client_msg_id":"aeafebe3-9019-4145-a872-e9a19efc9455","type":"message","user":"U017BU3UZBQ","text":"初めは↓のようになってました\u0026gt;\u0026lt;\n```call ddc#custom#patch_global('sources', [\n      \\ 'around',\n      \\ 'vim-lsp',\n      \\ 'file',\n      \\ ])```","ts":"1637738305.091800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"kwE"}]},{"client_msg_id":"74dca5c6-27d1-4fc3-8405-566d94b584a5","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"aroundが優先される設定だったのね","ts":"1637738263.091300","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"hai-small","count":1,"users":["U017BU3UZBQ"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"6gy"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e0dc82ba-2803-4fdf-aab0-3d2bdb554340","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"あーなるほど","ts":"1637738251.090800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Q7Kv"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1bc48744-e35a-4c99-91cc-ffc5505c8fa7","type":"message","user":"U017BU3UZBQ","text":"1回目と2回目で候補が違う’というのは1回目(バッファにdefineの文字がない)でarroundから候補が帰っていないためlspの候補が出てきたということだと思います","ts":"1637738196.090600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"q9Qw"}]},{"client_msg_id":"bea4e15c-9190-489e-8009-48b706ff1001","type":"message","user":"U017BU3UZBQ","text":"ソースの指定した順番という意味を理解するのに時間がかかり(+設定ミスりまくった)返事が遅れました、ありがとうございます！\n```call ddc#custom#patch_global('sources', [\n      \\ 'vim-lsp',\n      \\ 'file',\n      \\ 'around',\n      \\ ])```\n結果このように設定しなおし、望んだ順番で使うことができました :cat-dogeza-mike:","ts":"1637738100.088700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"aZt"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e3c314ae-8b48-450e-8bc0-2fc8390f4305","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"もしくはlspの候補がでるのに時間かかってるとか","ts":"1637737967.086800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"zP7JC"}]},{"client_msg_id":"fa636421-72a5-408e-ac6c-d7da3ea770df","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"一回目と二回目で候補が違うのは入力してる文字数が関係してるかな","ts":"1637737953.086200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Bdl8j"}]},{"client_msg_id":"368b2bd0-30a5-45fe-b350-e55719bcb5a9","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"そうです、指定した順番に必ずなります。\n優先度という概念はないです","ts":"1637737849.085500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"UvNb/"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a23fa6cf-93b0-4912-9469-843fe30d72df","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"ソースは指定した順番がそのまま優先順位のはずです","ts":"1637736543.084700","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"eyes","count":1,"users":["U017BU3UZBQ"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"V3Kq"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6ab27831-bec7-48a9-98d9-6b4d704695f6","type":"message","user":"U017BU3UZBQ","text":"質問です\nddcで“matcher_head”,“sorter_rank”を使用している状態で、“around”,“vim-lsp”ソースなどを利用している場合\nCなどの補完で一回めの`#define` ではvim-lspのマクロ(?)スニペット(?)が展開されるのですが、2回目では`#define` と打ってもarroundの結果が優先されてしまい展開されません。(添付画像①vim-lspからの候補になっている ②arroundの候補になっている)\n複数のsourceが同じ候補を返してきたときに、どちらの候補を優先するかといったオプションはありますか?","ts":"1637736327.083300","files":[{"id":"F02P5A95YAC","cre